Conflicts with qt6-webengine. Requires Qt 6.12.0 with Vulkan support.
Install vulkan-headers before rebuilding qt6-base if Vulkan support is disabled.
Proprietary codecs and QtPdf are not included.

To satisfy qt6-webengine dependencies, add to /etc/prt-get.aliases:

qt6-webengine-bin: qt6-webengine
